From: bornaradusin <43745159+bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:57:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Delete and manage requests and media

A movie's or series' page gets the Manage panel Seerr's web app has:
its requests (delete them), remove it from Radarr or Sonarr with its
files, mark it available, and clear its data. Request cards in the
request list get approve, decline, edit, retry, delete, cancel and
remove from Radarr/Sonarr, as on the web.
